  "description": "Rustic Western is a bold and charming retro display font inspired by classic western typography and vintage frontier aesthetics. Its strong letterforms, slightly rough edges, and nostalgic character bring an authentic old-west feel to any design.\nDesigned to stand out, this font works perfectly for headlines, posters, logos, branding, packaging, apparel, labels, signage, and themed designs. The chunky shapes and confident structure make it highly readable while delivering a powerful rustic personality.\nWhether you’re creating cowboy-inspired artwork, vintage branding, or retro-style graphics, Rustic Western adds a warm, classic, and adventurous touch that instantly grabs attention.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Rustic Western is a bold and charming retro display font inspired by classic western typography and vintage frontier aesthetics. Its strong letterforms, slightly rough edges, and nostalgic character bring an authentic old-west feel to any design.</p>\n<p>Designed to stand out, this font works perfectly for headlines, posters, logos, branding, packaging, apparel, labels, signage, and themed designs. The chunky shapes and confident structure make it highly readable while delivering a powerful rustic personality.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating cowboy-inspired artwork, vintage branding, or retro-style graphics, Rustic Western adds a warm, classic, and adventurous touch that instantly grabs attention.</p>",
